    "comment" : {
      "en" : "A qualified association that binds a runner (agent) to the processor instances (activities) it executes within a pipeline, and to the pipeline plan itself. As a subclass of prov:Association it qualifies the assignment of responsibility for those processors to their runner, and as a subclass of prov:ActivityInfluence it cites those processors directly with prov:activity."
    },
    "id" : "7",
